                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <a href="/quick-portfolio/portfolio/ojt-journals/" class="block mt-4">
                <h4
                  class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white group-hover:text-wood-accent transition-colors"
                >
                  OJT Daily Journal System
                </h4>
                <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-wood-accent mt-1 italic">
                  Pain Fixed: Messy paper log sheets, lost documents & slow manual auditing processes.
                </p>
                <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 text-sm mt-2 leading-relaxed">
                  Streamlined student log tracking and coordinator audits. Replaced physical log sheets with a secure, tamper-proof digital system, saving advisors 80% of their manual auditing hours.
                </p>
              </a>
            </div>

            <!-- 
              Project: tagForge (AI SEO & Metadata Generator)
              Description: Renders the summary preview card for the tagForge project in the portfolio gallery grid.
              Interaction / Filtering:
                - Filter Category: 'fullstack' (displays when 'All' or 'Fullstack' is selected).
                - View Details CTA: Links to the Astro details case study page: `/quick-portfolio/portfolio/tagforge/`.
                - Live Demo CTA: Links to the external production deployed application: `https://seo-project-21.vercel.app/`.
              Aesthetics & Design: 
                - Uses standard responsive grid grouping styles.
                - Features a vibrant thumbnail hover effect scaling the `../assets/tagForge.webp` asset.
                - Dynamic dark-mode compatible text headers and sleek high-contrast layout matching existing project cards.
            -->
